    "text": "By Jon Ross Myers ,\n13 hours ago Northeast Mississippi Community College’s Adult Education program said students selected professional clothing at no cost during a recent Dress for Success 2026 event. The program said the selections ranged from dress clothes to everyday essentials to help students prepare for job interviews, graduation and entering the workforce. Organizers said... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
